</div><p class="ssshop-editor-hint">Drag the text on the card preview to position it.</p></div><div class="ssshop-message-page-actions"><button type="button" class="ssshop-link-button" data-message-remove hidden>Delete this page</button><span data-page-editor-count>Page 1 of 1</span></div><small>Add up to 6 inside pages. Select a page above, then place and format its text directly on the card.</small></div><h4 class="ssshop-subheading">Sender details</h4><div class="ssshop-prefix-row"><label>Sender prefix<input name="from_prefix" maxlength="40" value="From" placeholder="From"></label><small>Examples: From, Love from, Lots of love from</small></div><label>Sender name<input name="sender_name" maxlength="100" required></label><label>Sender email address<input name="buyer_email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required><small>Used for your order confirmation and Stripe checkout.</small></label><label class="ssshop-privacy-choice"><span><input name="share_buyer_email" type="checkbox" value="yes"> Allow the recipient to reply to me by email</span><small>If selected, your email address will be shared with the recipient as the reply-to address. Leave this unticked to keep your email private; replies will go to the rescue’s configured reply-to address.</small></label><div class="ssshop-animation-choice"><label>Card opening animation<select name="card_reveal"><option value="gentle">Gentle reveal</option><option value="confetti">Confetti 🎉</option><option value="hearts">Falling hearts ❤️</option><option value="snow">Snow ❄️</option><option value="paws">Falling paw prints 🐾</option><option value="balloons">Floating balloons 🎈</option><option value="fireworks">Fireworks 🎆</option><option value="celebration">Celebration burst 🎊</option><option value="sparkles">Sparkle shower ✨</option><option value="cat-party">Cat party 😺</option><option value="none">No effect</option></select><small>Choose what the recipient sees when they open the card.</small></label></div><div class="ssshop